abstract: >
  Python package for detecting and repairing anomalous readings in electricity load series: a
  streaming recursive TEDA detector, a sparse window autoencoder, three reference detectors,
  a calendar-aware profile with a temperature regime, cross-checks of high readings against the
  expected profile, the interchange neighbours and the local temperature so that genuine extremes
  are kept, labelled anomaly injection, an audited repair step, a benchmark on public EIA-930
  hourly demand and an evaluation on four winter storms.
